  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.5.0`\n\n### Features\n\n- add a theme library of the schemes Ghostty ships, and theme import ([02d2b1c4](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/02d2b1c4c5eec564e4446ac2167ee2571226fb56))\n- number duplicated tabs web-2, web-3 instead of appending (Copy) ([196052fb](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/196052fb431246db093ea9512418e7cf27cc57f4))\n- start and stop tunnels from the tray menu ([565ebf82](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/565ebf82ad24effbc4d02821cce4de188f81c83a))\n- keep running in the tray when the main window closes ([9e5774ab](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/9e5774ab03572c49fe566ee6ea90c7b467989da4))\n\n### Fixes\n\n- hold PTY resizes until the session exists ([4a6c358c](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/4a6c358c5960972bc48497af3a98156ea45f4f98))\n- re-attach the Windows IME when WebView2 loses it after activation ([7459b986](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/7459b986744e480a93bbb4dd64c6b04d02c55fc1))\n- keep the IME textarea on screen before a composition starts ([395e9370](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/395e937004a0bfb1321c0ad3147e0509e232a70b))\n- keep the IME candidate window from jumping in TUI apps ([953a83ad](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/953a83ad3679087894098c24eaefeb13f13dff7a))\n\n### UI and usability\n\n- redesign the app icon as a key whose bow is a terminal window ([85c405ad](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/85c405ad597c6cc0acf48778eeba0b7411b23a61))\n\n### Other changes\n\n- drop dockview keyboardNavigation, enterprise-only since v8 ([1b3185c0](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/1b3185c01a0e3e83276cb8f88200467d6b719c24))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.5.0...v0.5.1](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.5.0...v0.5.1)\n",
